<title>UK: Wuerttembergische Hypo adds 50 mln mark to bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttembergische Hypo adds 50 mln mark to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and GZB-Bank, has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Wuerttembergische Hypothekenbank AG</p>
<p> AMT ***150 MLN DEM   COUPON  ** 4.00	MATURITY  * 02.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    02.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    STUTT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FOR FIRST YEAR, 5.00 PERCENT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    * CALLABLE ON 02.SEP.97 AT PAR</p>
<p>	  *** ORIGINALLY 100 MLN DEM</p>
<p>	   OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEFE SERIES 783</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
